n hope rather than evidence.","On the balance sheet, interest coverage of 40\u00d7 is fortress-like.","Shareholder yield is only 0.0%, a thin return of capital, and insiders hold 81% of the shares, so management thinks like owners because it is one \u2014 the strongest alignment there is."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 1/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Very elevated short interest (26.7% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting against the business","sev":"red","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Revenue growth lags most Healthcare peers \u2014 losing share inside the profit pool","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Financial quality metrics lag Healthcare peers","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Patent cliffs, drug-pricing reform, and reimbursement pressure \u2014 a single regulatory change can reset the pricing power that justifies the multiple.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Clinical trial concentration risk \u2014 binary FDA outcomes on a lead asset can wipe out billions in market cap in a single session.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"GLP-1 disruption across sub-sectors \u2014 weight-loss drugs are reshaping demand for orthopaedics, cardiovascular devices, and sleep-apnea treatments in ways not yet priced in.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","Valued at a 186% discount to sector median EV/EBITDA","Altman Z comfortably in the safe zone \u2014 a fortress balance sheet on this measure","Large open-market insider purchases (net $103.6M) \u2014 management putting its own capital behind the business","Minimal goodwill on the balance sheet \u2014 low impairment risk","Healthcare sector showing strong relative momentum, outperforming the market by 13% over 3 months","Healthcare ETF in a sustained uptrend above its long-term average","Strong 6-month sector performance (30.7% return)"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Is Summit Therapeutics (SMMT) Still Undervalued Following Mixed HARMONi Trial Results?","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/pharmaceuticals-biotech/nasdaq-smmt/summit-therapeutics/news/is-summit-therapeutics-smmt-still-undervalued-following-mixe","date":"2026-11-11","timestamp":1794385249.412,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.052,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Wall Street Analysts See a 62.33% Upside in Summit Therapeutics (SMMT): Can the Stock Really Move This High?","source":"zacks.com","link":"https://www.zacks.com/stock/news/3027269/wall-street-analysts-see-a-62-33-upside-in-summit-therapeutics-smmt-can-the-stock-really-move-this-high?cid=CS-ZC-FT-fundamental_analysis%7Cconsensus_price_target-3027269","date":"2026-11-10","timestamp":1794318903.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Summit Therapeutics (NASDAQ:SMMT) Share Price Breaks Above Two Hundred Day Moving Average \u2013 Time to Sell?","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/08/summit-therapeutics-nasdaqsmmt-share-price-breaks-above-two-hundred-day-moving-average-time-to-sell.html","date":"2026-11-08","timestamp":1794138067.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.878,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Technical Reactions to SMMT Trends in Macro Strategies","source":"news.stocktradersdaily.com","link":"https://news.stocktradersdaily.com/news_release/98/Technical_Reactions_to_SMMT_Trends_in_Macro_Strategies_110526092802_1793888882.html","date":"2026-11-05","timestamp":1793888882.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"SMMT's Q3 Earnings Beat Estimates, Ivonescimab Development in Focus","source":"zacks.com","link":"https://www.zacks.com/stock/news/3023860/smmt-s-q3-earnings-beat-estimates-ivonescimab-development-in-focus?cid=CS-ZC-FT-analyst_bl